Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quiet settled flight walked all shipLike trail candidates through
_engineDriveFor every emit tick even when every drive was below the idle
band. Latch after first empty emit; wake on cheap throttle/speed/actuator
proxy (+ entityIndexVersion). Empty _updateRibbonTrails shares the latch
when the ribbon map is empty. Soft-GPU fps not claimed.
---
 src/render/vfx.js | 126 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 122 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

